  "note": [
    "Hand-derived expectations. '@GP' = hex of the built genesisPre, '@GH' = keccak256 of it (computed by the runner so the case reaches the step it tests; the hash value is not a golden).",
    "Built specs start from the hand-decoded GSV1 fields (v3-gsv1.json expected) and apply overrides, then are encoded canonically with the accepted 0.2 RLP encoder.",
    "Length derivation (one M_0 entry = ea 94 <20> 94 <20> = 43 bytes; GSV1 CP encodes to 179; roots 33 each; specVersion 1; chainId 4): with 3-byte list headers, |genesisPre| = 256 + 43n for the GSV1 CP and n entries."
  ],
  "m0Rules": {
    "seq": "id_i = 0x10 || be19(i+1), i = 0..n-1; rewardAddr = id (author fixture rule, ascending, never reserved)",
    "network4": "4 placeholder HELD identities id_i = 0x20 || be19(i+1); the source does not list them (DG-V3-1)",
    "endfull": "w, x, y, z = fixture keys 3-6 (TK-1, m1-draft-0.5 eth_keys_ref.py) plus 1020 ids = last 20 bytes of keccak256('PoColEnd' || be32(i)), i = 0..1019; rewardAddr = id; sorted ascending; collision with zero/SYSTEM_ADDRESS/C0C001-C0C0FF or duplicate = FixtureSetupError('ids')"
  },
  "knownTestAddresses": {"note": "Well-known anvil/Hardhat default accounts 2-5 (= fixture keys 3-6 under TK-1); author recollection of public values, independent of the 0.5 derivation, to be confirmed by root",
